stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PRIVATE : Submit Key (Private Mode)\n K1+K2 attested, HKDF encrypted
    [*] --> OBSERVING : Submit Key (Community Mode)\n 24h observation buffer starts

    PRIVATE --> OBSERVING : Toggle to Community\n[GUARD: Not in 23:30–00:30 UTC Midnight Freeze]

    note right of PRIVATE
      Midnight Freeze Guard:
      Pool toggle PRIVATE→COMMUNITY
      blocked 23:30–00:30 UTC (Vector 17)
      to prevent quota gaming.
    end note

    OBSERVING --> COMMUNITY_ACTIVE : 24h Observation Elapses\n[observation_until < NOW()]
    COMMUNITY_ACTIVE --> PRIVATE : Toggle to Private\n[GUARD: Not in Midnight Freeze]

    COMMUNITY_ACTIVE --> QUOTA_JAIL_SOFT : debt_micro_cu > 0.5 × daily_contributed_micro_cu\nMultiplier capped at 1.5×
    QUOTA_JAIL_SOFT --> COMMUNITY_ACTIVE : Debt paid down\ndebug_micro_cu ≤ 0.5 × daily_contributed
    QUOTA_JAIL_SOFT --> QUOTA_JAIL_HARD : debt_micro_cu > 1.0 × daily_contributed_micro_cu\nRouting locked to own keys only

    QUOTA_JAIL_HARD --> QUOTA_JAIL_SOFT : 30% daily decay reduces debt\nbelow 1.0× threshold
    QUOTA_JAIL_HARD --> COMMUNITY_ACTIVE : Full debt repayment\n(debt = 0 → PRISTINE)

    COMMUNITY_ACTIVE --> ROTATING : Initiate Key Rotation\n30-min grace window starts
    PRIVATE --> ROTATING : Initiate Key Rotation\n30-min grace window starts
    QUOTA_JAIL_SOFT --> ROTATING : Initiate Key Rotation
    QUOTA_JAIL_HARD --> ROTATING : Initiate Key Rotation

    note right of ROTATING
      30-Minute Rotation Grace (FR-23):
      Submit replacement key within 30 min
      → vesting_tier PRESERVED.
      Replacement key enters OBSERVATION
      or PRIVATE (matching prior pool_type).
    end note

    ROTATING --> OBSERVING : New Community key submitted\n within 30-min grace window
    ROTATING --> PRIVATE : New Private key submitted\n within 30-min grace window
    ROTATING --> TOMBSTONED : 30-min grace window expires\nwithout replacement

    COMMUNITY_ACTIVE --> TOMBSTONED : Upstream returns 401 Unauthorized\n(key revoked by provider)
    OBSERVING --> TOMBSTONED : Upstream returns 401 Unauthorized\nduring health probe
    COMMUNITY_ACTIVE --> QUARANTINED : Consecutive upstream failures\n> threshold (hero/parasite detection)
    QUARANTINED --> COMMUNITY_ACTIVE : Upstream returns healthy responses\nafter exponential backoff
    QUARANTINED --> TOMBSTONED : Quarantine period expires\nwithout recovery

    note left of TOMBSTONED
      14-Day Tombstone (FR-14):
      GCP project hash registered in
      project_hash_registry as TOMBSTONED.
      Re-registration of SAME project
      blocked for 14 days.
    end note

    TOMBSTONED --> [*] : 14-day ban expires\n(project hash cleared from registry)
